WEBVTT

00:04:59.840 --> 00:05:03.856
rather than dealing with the folks
who are not as impacted,

00:05:03.880 --> 00:05:06.096
and expecting it to trickle down.

00:05:06.120 --> 00:05:07.696
MB: So I love the effervescence,

00:05:07.720 --> 00:05:08.936
bubbling up.

00:05:08.960 --> 00:05:10.696
AG: Effervescence -- like champagne.

00:05:10.720 --> 00:05:11.936
(Laughter)

00:05:11.960 --> 00:05:14.296
MB: Who doesn't love
a glass of champagne, right?

00:05:14.320 --> 00:05:15.736
Champagne and freedom, right?

00:05:15.760 --> 00:05:17.016
(Laughter)

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:18.600
What more could we want, y'all?

00:05:19.320 --> 00:05:22.256
So you all have been
doing this for a minute,

00:05:22.280 --> 00:05:25.656
and the last few years have been --

00:05:25.680 --> 00:05:27.016
well, I can't even imagine,

00:05:27.040 --> 00:05:29.416
but I'm sure very transformative.

00:05:29.440 --> 00:05:33.456
And I know that you all
have learned a lot about leadership.